Cell["\<\
A 3-array has no flat picture of its own, so it is drawn as a row of \
matrices, the first index choosing the matrix:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"69077a44-4546-6841-9d9c-f9ec8f1d63f8"],

Cell["ArrayGraphics[Array[#1 + #2 + #3 &, {2, 2, 2}]]", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"8b7aa4f7-39a5-c846-92a3-fedc121992ea"],

